From a1230467d8dfb0496c34924780b0242fc8c0ee09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aliaksei Ivanou <aliaksei.ivanou@innowise.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 19:28:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add retry loop with fresh test case attempts

Run failed test cases up to the configured retry budget inside RunContext. Reset trackers, fixtures, generators, and RNG state for each attempt, restore counters from superseded failures, emit balanced attempt events, and report final flaky metadata with cumulative output.

Expand X96 and its Python driver to cover execution limits, independent budgets, sections, generators, fixture lifecycles, output retention, RNG reproducibility, and legacy and multi-reporter compatibility.

Tests: phase6-validate.ps1 T05 basic (92/92) and all (156/156).
